@* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   StudentDashboardHero — the finalized Dashboard's ambient hero band.
   Visual source: design-reference/motiva/project/Motiva Student
   Dashboard V4.dc.html:85-126.

   V4 opens the page on a full-bleed ambient band carrying exactly three
   things, in this order:
     1. the greeting              (17px/700, quiet — not a page title)
     2. a two-ended context line  (current milestone ⟷ overall progress)
     3. the milestone stepper     + one label per step, the active one
                                    expandable into a task checklist

   It is rendered with MPageHeader Variant="Hero" — the variant built in
   Phase 3 from this exact band (ambient-hero wash, 40/30 block padding,
   the greeting styled quieter than a page title) and unused until now.

   READ-ONLY CHECKLIST (decision M.3): V4's prototype lets a student tick a
   project task done straight from this list. No API supports that — project
   tasks complete through the submission pipeline (submit → mentor approve →
   Moodle confirm), never a checkbox. The list therefore renders the real
   completion state and nothing more. Richer milestone detail stays reachable
   through the existing MilestoneDetailModal, opened from the stepper dot.
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@

